eta_1000 = 1/(alpha (t + t0)) = 5.0025   (alpha t + alpha^(1/4) - alpha = 0.199900)
eta_100000 = 1/(alpha (t + t0)) = 0.0990   (alpha t + alpha^(1/4) - alpha = 10.099900)
